{"steam_appid":3177890,"steam_name":"Rana Card","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3177890/168072743/dc13e74c838d103dca221247f5eacedde9ec40c4/1758007814/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758011746","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198546/d5cce8c87593ab1a2ab02bc001218cc488ad31b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758011746","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/83575f6dc4013e5dec2b7629eb50ae4eb772266a/ss_83575f6dc4013e5dec2b7629eb50ae4eb772266a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776218935","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/f1efff8a195065552ee5c8df84d3a1bd90a7f55f/ss_f1efff8a195065552ee5c8df84d3a1bd90a7f55f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776218935","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/29e5f66d6bde85d1fc161ace15b2641f01cdaf17/ss_29e5f66d6bde85d1fc161ace15b2641f01cdaf17.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776218935","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/d4add9c7746ffa3bb6532dc2e210087f2c6d6e16/ss_d4add9c7746ffa3bb6532dc2e210087f2c6d6e16.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776218935","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/dba895e53aaae1109a188013cc4743a28c046b09/ss_dba895e53aaae1109a188013cc4743a28c046b09.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776218935"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0188464f6604bb7859ea87fcbef3c2a4.avif?t=1776218935\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a farm manager and take on the KPI challenges set by TimeTech Corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards in thrilling, fast-paced moments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dodge or harness Time Explosions 💥,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock card packs and treasure chests to expand your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your cards to earn gold,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and chart your own path with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face branching events, harsh years, and even massive world-shaking cataclysms. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/0f0c63a9e73f7c93070293ac970321ab.avif?t=1776218935\" width=754 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1776218935\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/8e0358b03140aba6e762eacd5cdf6c1b.avif?t=1776218935 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><br><br> You are granted a magical bag filled with countless unique cards, each with its own Time Cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, you must balance a limited Time cap as you draw as many cards as you dare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😮 One more card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😏 Another one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😫 Just one more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision could be a stroke of brilliance, or the start of a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware: exceed your Time cap and a Time Explosion 💥 will erupt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all explosions are disasters, though—play the right cards, and you can twist them into opportunities or avoid them entirely 👌 <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/8f99f26a09c9702538e8f2a89b6cf50d.avif?t=1776218935\" width=765 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1776218935\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/562f53e4f2ca431fabf108a4bee7b95f.avif?t=1776218935 width=800 height=450 /></span>The game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique cards—including spells, plants, animals, buildings, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 powerful trinkets designed to create combos with different builds or enhance your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many options, the game offers dozens of distinct strategies, each providing its own unique experience.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/3291db59f38d0f7f1ac15d973fa04eea.avif?t=1776218935\" width=794 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1776218935\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/6ae37317331c418a993732c3c6bc2ee1.avif?t=1776218935 width=800 height=450 /></span>With time as your guiding thread, your journey will challenge you with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ impactful map events filled with meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ harsh years that are difficult to overcome but rich in rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ massive cataclysms with unique mechanics to test your resilience. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/d0eae589796c2671671006ee61eddc03.avif?t=1776218935\" width=782 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1776218935\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177890/extras_big/40845aafc0bee2b19025ae6fb95bc822.avif?t=1776218935 width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong><br><br><br>Open card packs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock supply crates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even try your luck with scratch cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold, new cards, and powerful trinkets—the game offers multiple ways to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reward system is designed to create richer experiences and deeper paths for player progression.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["VisionRana"],"publishers":["IndieArk"],"release_date":"Sep 15, 2025"}